Z||000000||saleenfiero||05-30-2001||05:16 PM||||I got some of that over lay stuff on my backlight right now and it looks okay, but I was wondering if you could buy really blackout taillights like the ricers have anywhere.  I want this because it will SUIT my total blackout color scheme on the car (black rims, limo tint), or where can you buy that spray on stuff on the net and how is it used?||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroLisa||05-30-2001||06:08 PM||||spray on tint: summit racing, although its not listed on the website. to use it, you just take out the taillights and spray the back side (not the outward facing side) of the clear plastic. ive used it, and its dark, looks good, not hard.||||reg||1
