Z||000004||Slammed Fiero||05-30-2001||07:26 PM||||Sparay tint is illegal in Canada , Crappy tire used to carry it but no longer. I got mine from summit when I was there. Make sure you botl everything back together really well.....One rest stop I had both tail lights , the next I was missing one..<P>$120-50?? (can't remember) later I had a new one from Ed Parks.<P>The lights don't shop upo well behind the tint. BUT I believe you can change the bulbs cheaply to a brighter setup<P>anyone know the exact #'s? I heard 906's for the pontiac (no I didn't tint the pontiac) and 1157's for the rest<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
